  "note": "After surface-dots by snes19xx (its README allows reuse with credit): Everforest graphite or warm paper, a transparent top bar of pills with window icons, the Hub column under the clock, 1 px green window borders with corners of 7, windows popping in on springs, the serif Cassini power menu and the stellarium lock screen, Manrope in the shell.",
